WEBVTT

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:05.735
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:10.006
Todoke Message

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:19.341
'Itsudemo anata wo Shinjiteirukara'

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:20.620
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:28.661
The Story of Saiunkoku
Ano toki yume ni miteita
Sekai ni tatteirunoni

00:00:28.661 --> 00:00:28.990
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:36.397
Miwatasu keshiki ni
Ashi wo sukoshi sukumase

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:40.900
Dakedo ushiro furimukanaide

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:45.000
Aruiteyuku koto
Kimeta kara

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:49.407
Miageta sora
Nana iro no niji

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:52.983
Anata mo mitemasuka?

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:57.312
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:57.624 --> 00:01:01.458
Todoke Message

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:09.961
Yumeni kakedashita senaka
Mimamoru kara

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:14.339
Maiagaru kaze yo

00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:18.541
Hi no hikari matoi

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:28.444
Jiyuu no tsubasa de
Tsuyoku tobitatou

00:01:32.692 --> 00:01:36.788
Shurei Hong, the first ever
female official of Saiunkoku...

00:01:37.063 --> 00:01:39.531
...and Eigetsu To, the youngest
ever official of Saiunkoku...

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:43.931
...will be serving as
co-governors of Sa Province.

00:01:46.005 --> 00:01:49.463
The big pot is on the top shelf.
The tea leaves are in there.

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:53.178
I've written down where
you'll find everything.

00:01:55.048 --> 00:01:57.175
You'll be all right
alone, won't you, Father?

00:01:57.417 --> 00:01:59.385
There's no need to worry.

00:02:01.988 --> 00:02:07.722
Um, Father... There's
something I must tell you.

00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:09.523
- What is it?
- Well...!

00:02:09.596 --> 00:02:11.154
My Lady.

00:02:11.698 --> 00:02:13.928
Would you mind if
I went out for a moment?

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.968
I don't mind. Where are you going?

00:02:16.336 --> 00:02:18.304
I'll be right back.

00:02:22.575 --> 00:02:24.543
What did you want to see me for?

00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:27.113
Oh, we can talk later.

00:02:29.782 --> 00:02:33.240
Ensei Ro, as assistant to
the two young governors...

00:02:33.853 --> 00:02:36.822
...and Seiran Si, to protect them
as their military officer...

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:39.954
...will be accompanying
the two to Sa Province.

00:02:42.095 --> 00:02:45.622
Summer is approaching.
The time to leave is near.

00:02:49.435 --> 00:02:51.403
Sa Province.

00:02:54.107 --> 00:02:59.067
Flowers Blooming from Dead Trees

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:08.150
Big brother.

00:03:09.589 --> 00:03:11.557
Big brother Seien.

00:03:13.526 --> 00:03:15.016
Big brother Seien.

00:03:15.795 --> 00:03:17.820
Did your other
brothers tease you again?

00:03:18.598 --> 00:03:20.566
They tell me that I'm an unwanted child.

00:03:20.867 --> 00:03:25.201
That it would've been better if I
wasn't born. Even mother said so.

00:03:26.306 --> 00:03:31.005
What they say isn't true.
I'm truly grateful that you're here.

00:03:31.778 --> 00:03:32.676
Really?

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:34.972
Yes, really.

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:43.215
Mother, I brought you your medicine.

00:03:48.861 --> 00:03:50.829
Please drink it later.

00:03:52.966 --> 00:03:54.957
If only you didn't exist.

00:03:56.636 --> 00:04:00.128
If only I hadn't given birth to you,
things would've been much better.

00:04:01.841 --> 00:04:05.709
She was prone to illness.
She was a weak-hearted person.

00:04:07.614 --> 00:04:12.347
Rather than receiving affection from
the king as the bloom of the harem...

00:04:13.319 --> 00:04:15.753
...and giving birth to me,
the Second Prince...

00:04:16.456 --> 00:04:19.084
...she would've been much happier living
a peaceful life in a quiet place.

00:04:22.462 --> 00:04:24.828
I had five brothers born
to a different mother...

00:04:25.632 --> 00:04:29.796
...but only the youngest,
Ryuki, loved me as a brother.

00:04:31.037 --> 00:04:34.837
And I also found comfort
in being with Ryuki.

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:41.310
We were similar in that nobody
found either one of us necessary.

00:04:51.291 --> 00:04:53.259
You've beaten me soundly.

00:04:56.796 --> 00:04:58.764
You've improved your skills.

00:04:58.965 --> 00:05:00.762
At this rate, you could very well be...

00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:02.926
...champion of the next martial
arts tournament, Seien.

00:05:03.536 --> 00:05:05.504
No, I still have a long way to go.

00:05:05.705 --> 00:05:08.173
Sure you do. Of course
you have a long way to go.

00:05:08.708 --> 00:05:12.007
The way of the sword is not
something you can learn that easily.

00:05:17.383 --> 00:05:20.375
Oh, Ryuki.
May I request a bout with you?

00:05:28.094 --> 00:05:30.062
Come at me.

00:05:33.399 --> 00:05:37.631
If only I had realized the extent
of my cleverness and foolishness...

00:05:39.072 --> 00:05:42.132
...there might have been a path for me
different from the one I'm on now.

00:05:50.383 --> 00:05:52.351
Winner, Seien Shi!

00:06:08.835 --> 00:06:10.132
That was impressive.

00:06:10.303 --> 00:06:11.292
Father.

00:06:15.074 --> 00:06:17.042
You did well, Seien.

00:06:19.212 --> 00:06:21.180
These are the twin swords
Kansho and Bakuya...

00:06:21.247 --> 00:06:23.613
...passed down from generation to
generation within the Royal Family.

00:06:23.683 --> 00:06:26.151
You have shown excellence in both
literary and military arts, and therefore...

00:06:26.219 --> 00:06:28.187
...are most suited to have these.

00:06:28.488 --> 00:06:32.584
I humbly accept them,
Father... no, King Senka.

00:06:39.932 --> 00:06:43.333
If only I had realized my foolishness.

00:06:45.605 --> 00:06:47.573
Seien, as king?

00:06:50.309 --> 00:06:53.437
Seien is far more skilled
than any of his brothers.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:57.479
However, as things are, the throne
will belong to the First Prince.

00:06:58.418 --> 00:07:02.377
You don't want to be a
concubine forever, do you?

00:07:03.122 --> 00:07:04.953
But Father...!

00:07:05.792 --> 00:07:09.888
If Seien took the throne,
many would approve.

00:07:10.763 --> 00:07:13.323
The First Prince will be assassinated
the other Princes will be...

00:07:13.433 --> 00:07:14.957
...kicked out of the palace...

00:07:15.067 --> 00:07:18.002
...and King Senka will
retire from his position.

00:07:18.104 --> 00:07:23.041
You have nothing to worry about.
Leave everything to me.

00:07:28.047 --> 00:07:30.015
This is Bakuya, one of the twin swords.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:32.615
You're giving this to me?

00:07:33.152 --> 00:07:35.586
I want you to have it.
You have potential.

00:07:36.456 --> 00:07:37.354
But...!

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:41.951
Think of Bakuya as me. If you do that,
you won't be lonely even if you're alone.

00:07:42.795 --> 00:07:45.093
It will surely protect you.

00:07:46.499 --> 00:07:48.126
Big brother Seien.

00:08:11.457 --> 00:08:13.721
We are ordered to arrest you
for suspicion of rebellious actions...

00:08:13.793 --> 00:08:14.657
...against the Court.

00:08:15.595 --> 00:08:17.392
Rebellious actions?

00:08:17.497 --> 00:08:20.933
Yes. Your mother and grandfather have
both been taken in.

00:08:22.034 --> 00:08:23.797
Please do not resist us.

00:08:28.341 --> 00:08:30.275
Everything had been planned.

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:34.777
It was a scheme planned out
by my brothers and consorts...

00:08:35.448 --> 00:08:37.416
...who did not approve of my existence.

00:08:42.421 --> 00:08:45.413
My grandfather was tricked
into that conspiracy.

00:08:55.801 --> 00:08:58.531
Seien knew nothing about this, did he?

00:08:59.071 --> 00:09:00.595
It can't be helped.

00:09:00.673 --> 00:09:03.141
Consider him lucky to
be saved from execution...

00:09:03.209 --> 00:09:05.177
...thanks to the kindness of King Senka.

00:09:06.279 --> 00:09:08.247
If only you didn't exist.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:19.885
I had no lingering attachment for the
palace. I was only worried about Ryuki.

00:09:24.931 --> 00:09:29.300
Big brother Seien. Why
won't you come to see me?

00:09:37.276 --> 00:09:41.337
Perhaps my brothers did not feel
it was enough to have me exiled.

00:09:42.148 --> 00:09:44.207
They had sent assassins,
whom I encountered...

00:09:44.917 --> 00:09:47.545
...just before I reached the
land I was being exiled to.

00:09:58.331 --> 00:10:02.199
If only you didn't exist. If only
you hadn't been born into this world!

00:10:03.536 --> 00:10:04.468
Mother!

00:10:08.774 --> 00:10:10.765
If asked if I loved her...

00:10:10.843 --> 00:10:12.902
...I'd have to say I don't know.
She was that kind of mother.

00:10:13.312 --> 00:10:15.974
But she gave birth to me.

00:10:24.724 --> 00:10:26.692
There was no way I could've hated her.

00:10:30.396 --> 00:10:32.364
Mother.

00:10:42.308 --> 00:10:45.471
You're taking me awfully lightly.
Just who do you think I am?

00:10:46.512 --> 00:10:50.073
My name is Seien! When it comes to
swordsmanship, I will not fall to you!

00:10:51.017 --> 00:10:55.113
At the age of twelve, I received
Kansho and Bakuya from King Senka!

00:10:56.222 --> 00:10:59.885
If you intend to take my life, you
shall come at me prepared to die!

00:11:18.144 --> 00:11:20.305
I defeated all the assassins.

00:11:23.249 --> 00:11:26.309
But hell hadn't ended for me yet.

00:11:43.035 --> 00:11:47.995
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:11:51.811 --> 00:11:55.269
Why are you looking so
gloomy? It's not like you.

00:11:56.716 --> 00:11:59.617
I'm a bit worried about Seiran.

00:11:59.685 --> 00:12:00.310
Seiran?

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:04.153
Have I ever told you?
At one point nine years ago...

00:12:04.223 --> 00:12:07.283
...I was ordered by my brothers to find
the whereabouts of the missing Seiran...

00:12:08.127 --> 00:12:11.324
...or Prince Seien.

00:12:11.964 --> 00:12:13.363
I'm hearing this for the first time.

00:12:13.432 --> 00:12:16.299
I'm surprised the Ran Clan
would plan something so stupid.

00:12:17.036 --> 00:12:20.335
Of course, it wasn't like they were
trying to make Prince Seien king...

00:12:20.439 --> 00:12:22.839
...and add to the already
delicate internal problems.

00:12:23.609 --> 00:12:25.577
I wonder about that.

00:12:25.678 --> 00:12:27.646
They wanted to
find him and protect him...

00:12:27.947 --> 00:12:30.609
...before people who were thinking
exactly that, found him.

00:12:30.683 --> 00:12:32.412
Better to avoid unnecessary
conflict, right?

00:12:34.353 --> 00:12:37.083
Besides, he was pretty
good with the sword.

00:12:37.456 --> 00:12:39.981
My older brothers probably
thought Prince Seien...

00:12:40.326 --> 00:12:43.818
...would be capable of taking on any
attacks by assassins after his life.

00:12:45.297 --> 00:12:48.562
Assassins. Which reminds me,
rumor has it...

00:12:49.335 --> 00:12:51.303
...that the previous
king sent Black Wolf...

00:12:51.437 --> 00:12:55.237
...to protect Prince Seien
from the assassins.

00:12:56.475 --> 00:12:58.443
Protect Seien.
You mustn't let those fools...

00:12:58.511 --> 00:13:01.207
...have things the
way they want them.

00:13:01.947 --> 00:13:03.414
Go, Black Wolf!

00:13:03.783 --> 00:13:04.408
Yes!

00:13:05.751 --> 00:13:08.049
The legendary assassin, Black Wolf.

00:13:08.721 --> 00:13:12.316
Because even the previous king
had his eye on Prince Seien.

00:13:13.359 --> 00:13:15.327
Given his position,
he had no choice but...

00:13:15.394 --> 00:13:17.885
...to exile Seien
for his alleged involvement.

00:13:18.364 --> 00:13:21.162
But the king wasn't about
to see him get killed.

00:13:21.767 --> 00:13:23.735
Mind you, they're just rumors.

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:27.061
Regardless of whether Black
Wolf was dispatched or not...

00:13:27.873 --> 00:13:31.775
...the fact is I was unable
to find Seien back then.

00:13:34.413 --> 00:13:37.940
So, Koyu. Do you know
where he was exiled?

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:42.685
That's right. Sa Province.

00:13:43.222 --> 00:13:45.952
It was fourteen years ago
when we lost track of him.

00:13:46.058 --> 00:13:48.356
It was not too long after the new year.

00:13:48.828 --> 00:13:52.696
And I understand it was late that
year that Shoka took in Seiran.

00:14:00.306 --> 00:14:03.503
So what was he doing in Sa Province
during that year?

00:14:05.344 --> 00:14:08.245
I've decided. Your name
is going to be Seiran.

00:14:09.315 --> 00:14:10.782
Seiran.

00:14:16.322 --> 00:14:18.290
I guess you'll be lonely without her.

00:14:20.192 --> 00:14:22.160
It's what she wished for.

00:14:22.494 --> 00:14:25.691
Besides, I'm sure flowers will bloom
on the withered trees this summer.

00:14:26.232 --> 00:14:29.895
Flowers that have not bloomed once over
the past nine years will return this year.

00:14:31.837 --> 00:14:34.670
Nine years? The year of the civil war.

00:14:35.507 --> 00:14:36.269
Yes.

00:14:37.109 --> 00:14:40.772
Since the rebellion by Second Prince
Seien's grandfather fourteen years ago...

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:43.539
...this country has maintained calmness.

00:14:44.850 --> 00:14:46.818
At least on the surface,
that is.

00:14:53.158 --> 00:14:57.322
Nine years ago, the former king, Senka
Shi was bedridden, due to sickness.

00:14:59.331 --> 00:15:01.299
That's what triggered the civil war.

00:15:03.469 --> 00:15:05.437
Sickness has gotten the better of me.

00:15:05.804 --> 00:15:08.272
It is no longer possible for
me to ever take center stage.

00:15:08.707 --> 00:15:10.675
I'm leaving you in charge, Advisor Sho.

00:15:11.543 --> 00:15:12.032
Yes.

00:15:12.978 --> 00:15:14.946
Saiunkoku has fallen ill.

00:15:15.814 --> 00:15:19.272
In order for this country to
continue surviving in the future...

00:15:20.085 --> 00:15:23.213
...it must be reborn, no matter
what it takes to do so.

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:28.784
You can count on me. I will make sure
your desires are met, King Senka.

00:15:39.571 --> 00:15:41.471
The debate on who would
succeed the throne...

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:44.008
...had been going on below the
surface until that point...

00:15:44.143 --> 00:15:46.907
...but upon notice of the king falling
ill, it burst out into the open.

00:15:47.513 --> 00:15:49.481
The four princes, excluding Ryuki...

00:15:49.648 --> 00:15:52.173
...fought aggressively to earn
the right to the throne.

00:15:55.788 --> 00:15:57.983
The struggle soon developed
into a civil war.

00:15:58.123 --> 00:16:00.489
The government could no
longer be run properly...

00:16:00.592 --> 00:16:03.026
...and the functions of the
Royal Court became stagnant.

00:16:05.631 --> 00:16:07.599
The people hurt
the most were the citizens.

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:11.327
If the Royal Court isn't running,
conditions across the nation worsen.

00:16:12.638 --> 00:16:14.731
What do you mean you
can't pay the money?!

00:16:14.807 --> 00:16:16.399
If you can't pay,
then we're not interested!

00:16:16.475 --> 00:16:18.875
What are these ridiculous prices?!
You're ripping us off!

00:16:18.944 --> 00:16:21.708
I can't help it!
The goods aren't coming in!

00:16:25.417 --> 00:16:27.544
As if that weren't enough...

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:30.115
...drought and floods
assaulted the capital...

00:16:30.723 --> 00:16:32.918
...leading to plague and famine.

00:16:40.366 --> 00:16:42.334
Thank you very much.

00:16:44.069 --> 00:16:49.063
Why will you not take action?! You have
the ability to control this civil war!

00:16:49.575 --> 00:16:50.542
Advisor Sho!

00:16:52.678 --> 00:16:56.409
Unless you do something about it
fast, this country... the people...!

00:16:58.050 --> 00:17:00.348
I'm waiting.

00:17:03.222 --> 00:17:05.190
What was he waiting for?

00:17:05.691 --> 00:17:07.659
Advisor Sho...!

00:17:07.926 --> 00:17:11.327
I'm waiting for a king truly
worthy of serving his country.

00:17:12.264 --> 00:17:15.097
And what do you intend to do
if no such person comes forth?!

00:17:15.667 --> 00:17:17.532
Without a good king...

00:17:18.203 --> 00:17:20.671
Saiunkoku
is better off perishing.

00:17:37.523 --> 00:17:39.491
This country is finished.

00:17:42.194 --> 00:17:44.458
Everyone thought so, and had lost hope.

00:18:05.084 --> 00:18:07.052
Ryuki, do you want it too?

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:11.111
The throne, like your brothers.

00:18:18.464 --> 00:18:21.399
There appears to be something
more important to you.

00:18:24.403 --> 00:18:30.899
In the end, Advisor Sho found the
potential to be a true king within Ryuki.

00:18:43.489 --> 00:18:47.289
Advisor Sho introduced one policy
after another, and executed them.

00:18:48.227 --> 00:18:51.685
He saved the citizens, and devoted his
efforts to rebuilding the Royal Court.

00:18:52.397 --> 00:18:54.763
Princes and officials
prioritizing personal power...

00:18:54.967 --> 00:18:56.832
...over the well-being of the citizens...

00:18:58.137 --> 00:19:01.038
...were either exiled or executed.

00:19:02.741 --> 00:19:06.939
All that hampered the Royal Court
since the civil war was cleaned out...

00:19:07.546 --> 00:19:11.482
...and as a result, the court
was purified and reborn.

00:19:12.251 --> 00:19:16.950
Everything went as the former
king and Advisor Sho wanted, didn't it?

00:19:20.926 --> 00:19:23.087
The country quickly recovered.

00:19:30.802 --> 00:19:34.067
As if guided by an invisible force.

00:19:37.576 --> 00:19:42.946
Beautiful. This has become a
country suitable for Ryuki.

00:19:44.082 --> 00:19:46.050
And two years ago...

00:19:48.587 --> 00:19:50.555
Become king, Ryuki.

00:19:51.957 --> 00:19:53.925
Become king!

00:19:59.665 --> 00:20:01.428
Following the coronation ceremony...

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:05.300
...Ryuki would act like a fool waiting
for the return of Prince Seien.

00:20:05.437 --> 00:20:08.304
But his encounter with Princess...

00:20:08.407 --> 00:20:10.102
...awakened his inner
consciousness as a king.

00:20:11.276 --> 00:20:14.370
I'm sure Ryuki will become a great king.

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:17.175
And this country...!

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:20.475
I'm sure it will blossom.

00:20:21.253 --> 00:20:23.380
I'm sure flowers will bloom everywhere.

00:20:24.256 --> 00:20:26.884
Enough to fill this yard.
Enough to fill the country.

00:20:27.859 --> 00:20:31.818
Yes. And that's why I'm not lonely.

00:20:33.398 --> 00:20:36.299
- Father. Has Seiran returned yet?
- No.

00:20:36.969 --> 00:20:38.937
I wonder where he went.

00:20:39.037 --> 00:20:41.028
Seiran's probably...!

00:20:44.209 --> 00:20:48.202
If you were gonna visit her grave,
you should've just told us.

00:20:49.948 --> 00:20:52.542
Well, I guess there are
times you'd rather be alone.

00:20:55.988 --> 00:20:57.956
Are you sure about it?

00:20:58.557 --> 00:21:02.459
Returning to Sa Province
may prove difficult for you.

00:21:03.061 --> 00:21:07.395
The Murderous Blades... No,
you probably don't want to be reminded.

00:21:08.367 --> 00:21:10.062
I will protect Lady Shurei.

00:21:10.269 --> 00:21:13.568
I will go to Sa Province,
no matter what awaits me there.

00:21:19.278 --> 00:21:21.246
I pledge to my sword!

00:21:31.590 --> 00:21:34.058
You should've told us
you were coming here.

00:21:34.259 --> 00:21:36.750
Ensei said the same thing.

00:21:42.267 --> 00:21:44.758
There's something I
must say to you, Father.

00:21:46.571 --> 00:21:49.699
Well... Um...!

00:21:53.345 --> 00:21:55.313
Thank you!

00:21:55.914 --> 00:21:59.247
Thank you for bringing me up properly,
and listening to my selfish desires...

00:22:00.719 --> 00:22:04.712
...and allowing me to go to Sa Province.

00:22:05.824 --> 00:22:07.792
Thank you so much.

00:22:09.628 --> 00:22:11.493
I haven't done anything.

00:22:11.563 --> 00:22:14.589
Shurei, it was your own strong will
that allowed you to grasp this.

00:22:16.535 --> 00:22:18.025
Father.

00:22:18.403 --> 00:22:21.304
You go out there and make the most
magnificent flower bloom, Shurei.

00:22:23.408 --> 00:22:24.306
Yes!

00:22:25.777 --> 00:22:29.042
And Seiran. Thanks for everything so far.

00:22:32.150 --> 00:22:35.119
I've decided. Your name
is going to be Seiran.

00:22:37.689 --> 00:22:39.657
And from now on.

00:22:39.925 --> 00:22:41.552
Seiran.

00:22:43.161 --> 00:22:48.258
Seiran. I'm so very glad
to have you by my side.

00:22:50.535 --> 00:22:52.503
My Lady.

00:23:00.879 --> 00:23:03.609
If only you hadn't existed, it
would've been so much better.

00:23:06.585 --> 00:23:11.454
No, I'm very grateful that
you gave birth to me, Mother.

00:23:14.326 --> 00:23:17.022
I will do everything within my
power to protect you, My Lady.

00:23:22.134 --> 00:23:23.692
Everything.

00:23:30.475 --> 00:23:35.572
Itsumo sugoku jiyu na anata ha ima

00:23:35.781 --> 00:23:42.118
Kono ame no naka donna
Yume wo oikaketeiruno

00:23:42.421 --> 00:23:47.381
Dokokade kodoku to tatakainagara

00:23:47.592 --> 00:23:52.689
Namida mo gaman shiterundarou

00:23:53.698 --> 00:23:58.101
Hitori demo daijobu to

00:23:59.638 --> 00:24:04.769
Anata mo watashi to onaji

00:24:05.544 --> 00:24:16.113
Tomawari bakari dakedo
Nazeka kono michi ga suki de

00:24:16.988 --> 00:24:22.585
Shiawase da toka ureshii toki ha

00:24:22.994 --> 00:24:28.057
Anata no koto wo omoidasu kara

00:24:28.934 --> 00:24:34.497
Iroazayaka na kisetsu ha kitto

00:24:34.873 --> 00:24:41.676
Kono omoi todoketekureru

